{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>52歲男星劉愷威自今年單身後火速迎來新戀情，近日被捕獲與32歲女友黎紀君在深圳商場高調拍拖放閃。兩人全程毫不避 …</p><p></p>\n<p>52歲男星劉愷威自今年單身後火速迎來新戀情，近日被捕獲與32歲女友黎紀君在深圳商場高調拍拖放閃。兩人全程毫不避忌地展現親密互動，一身黑白情侶裝打扮更是吸引眾人目光。這段相差20年忘年戀在人前展現出令人意想不到甜蜜狀態。</p>\n<h2>劉愷威黎紀君深圳商場高調放閃</h2>\n<p>近日有網民在深圳一間商場野生捕獲熱戀中劉愷威與黎紀君。相中清晰可見男方頭戴黑色Cap帽配襯黑色上衣，女方則以全白休閒服裝示人，完美配搭出低調且合襯黑白情侶裝。兩人在逛街期間互動非常自然鬆弛，女方不僅單手推着行李箱緊隨男友身旁，更在商場人群中甜蜜挽住男方手臂同行。其後兩人一同前往餐廳用膳兼各自玩手機，相處狀態猶如老夫老妻般融洽自在。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488772934319122_14622303676afbd031ef30c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261116113437245-1116_00862_001_03p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488772934319122_14622303676afbd031ef30c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>父親劉丹對未來新抱開綠燈支持</h2>\n<p>其實這段戀情曝光後，兩位當事人已經毫不避忌大方認愛，並對外透露雙方是因為熱愛打匹克球與網球而在球場上擦出愛火。對於兒子迅速展開新一段關係，向來着緊家人父親劉丹亦大方開出綠燈。劉丹早前公開回應傳媒時表示非常盼望能盡快見面，更以「同聲同氣」形容這位未來新抱，女方成功在未正式入門前獲得男方家長高度認可及祝福。</p>\n<h2>告別李曉峰火速投入新一段戀情</h2>\n<p>回顧男方過去數年感情史，自2018年與內地女星楊冪正式離婚後，其私生活動向一直備受外界高度關注。直到今年4月，他與另一內地女星李曉峰低調處理感情悄然畫上句號，宣告重返單身行列。沒想到分手短短數月後，他便透過運動結緣火速與年輕20年新歡秘密撻着，隨着兩人感情逐漸穩定，約會模式亦由地下情轉為公開高調放閃。</p>\n<h2>網民直擊十指緊扣留言大讚甜蜜</h2>\n<p>這次商場約會照片在網絡上流出後隨即掀起大批網民熱烈討論。不少親身目擊兩人互動網民紛紛在社交平台發文分享現場細節，有人直接留言指出兩人「一路上十指緊扣」。同時亦有大批網民將焦點放在他們日常相處狀態上，紛紛留言大讚「十分甜蜜」，並形容雙方互動自然不造作，在公眾場合展現出「感情相當穩定」一面。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773050158838_901020406afbd0331d0f5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261116113437245-1116_00862_001_06p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773050158838_901020406afbd0331d0f5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773180688796_12785626226afbd034c4419.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261116113437245-1116_00862_001_04p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773180688796_12785626226afbd034c4419.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773341551073_13086060316afbd035ea443.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261116113437245-1116_00862_001_05p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773341551073_13086060316afbd035ea443.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773474883730_21430755296afbd03719305.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261116113437245-1116_00862_001_08p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773474883730_21430755296afbd03719305.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179247305725017593_12283288216ad6f7e189797.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"5i0j-5Iv5CieIGzYhrV5ap0XK4ifEr9xppWIEaaViBE.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179247305725017593_12283288216ad6f7e189797.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179247305551942579_2771954016ad6f7dfc1db1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"W3L50QUc79y4okG6nzsm3WfiXuRMArncYZUdQGGVHUA.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179247305551942579_2771954016ad6f7dfc1db1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>與劉愷威因匹克球而相識（圖片來源：IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8a%89%e6%84%b7%e5%a8%81/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">劉愷威</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%ab%98%e8%aa%bf%e6%94%be%e9%96%83/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">高調放閃</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%8e%e7%b4%80%e5%90%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黎紀君</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544374\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:19:30.981779+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1258,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:55:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T05:42:42.295823+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:58.403998+00:00","content_hash":"db7193a29507c6a6db6e5167b6cbc4f020f65288722b5f8bde0c01cc6a7b8afc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}